{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>For everyone who wishes to be kind, and for those who can only live with kindness.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/15e523eb469cdb781c479187e19cd381.avif?t=1759540357\" width=407 height=199 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/d75dc719fcc3ae4e6491e9f9e56274d3.poster.avif?t=1759540357\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/d75dc719fcc3ae4e6491e9f9e56274d3.webm?t=1759540357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Robot Hospice&quot;</strong> is a heartfelt adventure game about bidding farewell to beloved robots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0Welcome to Robot Hospice!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A place where cherished robots spend their final days\u2014the <strong>Robot Hospice</strong>.<br>As <strong>Midori</strong>, a new staff member, you will interact with these robots, share their memories, and face both partings and self-discovery along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/725befe92603be9ae2c25faf747179d1.avif?t=1759540357\" data-has-big width=800 height=522 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0Your Role</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal in this game is to <strong>see all five robots through their final moments</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By talking to the robots and strengthening your bond with them,<br>you will learn about their past and their final wishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83d\udda4 <strong>Your choices in conversations and actions will shape how you say goodbye.</strong></u><br>Do your best to give them the most peaceful farewell possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0A Nostalgic and Heartwarming World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds in a world depicted with <strong>charming 2D pixel art</strong> and accompanied by <strong>classic Famicom tunes</strong>.<br>Immerse yourself in an atmosphere filled with warmth and nostalgia.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0Estimated Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd52 <strong>1 to 2 hours</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590010?t=1759540357","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590010?t=1759540357","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/9bc60afbe71c6d6b802e36da6e3f688c4ce415b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759540357","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/9bc60afbe71c6d6b802e36da6e3f688c4ce415b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759540357","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4056330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>For everyone who wishes to be kind, and for those who can only live with kindness.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><im